                                              "A role held by an entity that is an approved course provider under Australian higher education regulations." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is an approved course provider under Australian regulatory provisions." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is an approved course provider under Australian regulatory requirements." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is an approved course provider under the VSL Act." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is an approved course provider under the relevant Australian VET regulatory framework." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is an approved course provider under the relevant Australian regulatory framework." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is an approved course provider under the relevant regulatory framework." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is an approved provider of a course under the relevant Australian regulatory framework." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to offer VET Student Loans courses in Australia." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to offer courses and charge tuition fees under Australian regulatory requirements." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to offer courses under the relevant regulatory framework." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide VET Student Loan courses under the VSL Act." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide VET Student Loans courses under Australian regulation." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide VET courses under Australian regulations." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide courses under Australian regulatory frameworks." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide courses under Australian regulatory requirements." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide courses under the Act and Rules." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide courses under the VET Student Loans program." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide courses under the VET Student Loans scheme." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide courses under the relevant Australian legislation." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide courses under the relevant Australian regulatory framework." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide courses under the relevant regulatory framework." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that is approved to provide vocational education and training courses." ,
                                              "A role held by an entity that offers approved courses under Australian regulatory requirements." ,
                                              "A role held by an organisation approved to offer VET Student Loans courses in Australia." ,
                                              "A role held by an organisation approved to provide VET Student Loan courses in Australia." ,
